# name: user default
# The integration's default (USB audio, no boot logo) made to fit with the least loss to the sound
# (docs/HANDOFF-fm1.md suggestion: LOFI and VOICE out, the delay at 0.74 s), then the SCRATCH sample set
# (23 KB: the SCRATCH preset; the set can still be uploaded to a USR slot). Every other set and kit, the icons,
# VIEW ALL and FM6's OPL mode stay. With the SLOOP 2.3 fixes (on by default: stricter flash checks, USB MIDI flow
# control, the overload fade, keys ~1 ms sooner, the knobs' one rest state: +736 B), FM6's operator editor in VIEW
# ALL goes too (1 KB: the operators' pages one at a time).
ENG_LOFI=0
ENG_FORMANT=0
DLY_LEN=32768
SET_SCRCH=0
FM6_ALL=0
